  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;A KIND OF HUSH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ALBUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Kind of Hush is the seventh studio album by the Carpenters, released in 1976, and includes hit singles such as 'There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARPENTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carpenters is an American music duo responsible for the album 'A Kind of Hush', known for their hit singles and professional challenges."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RICHARD CARPENTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Richard Carpenter is a member of the Carpenters and faced professional challenges due to his addiction to sleeping pills during the recording of 'A Kind of Hush'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THERE'S A KIND OF HUSH (ALL OVER THE WORLD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SONG"</data>
      <data key="d1">"There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World) is a hit single from the album 'A Kind of Hush', originally a cover of a 1960s song by Herman's Hermits."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HERMAN'S HERMITS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Herman's Hermits is the original creators of the song 'There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)', which was covered by the Carpenters."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK TOP 30&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UK Top 30 is a chart where 'There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)' reached a position, indicating its popularity in the United Kingdom."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US TOP 20&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US Top 20 is a chart where 'There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)' reached a position, indicating its popularity in the United States."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADULT CONTEMPORARY CHART&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adult Contemporary Chart is a chart where 'There's a Kind of Hush (All Over the World)' topped, indicating its popularity in the adult contemporary genre."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HORIZON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ALBUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Horizon is the previous album by the Carpenters, released in 1975, preceding 'A Kind of Hush'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PASSAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ALBUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Passage is the next album by the Carpenters, released in 1977, following 'A Kind of Hush'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE BEATLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Beatles is mentioned as another artist who released an album titled 'A Kind of Hush' in 1976, though it is not the same album as by the Carpenters."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0013-fcb586e26f97</data>
    </node>
